{
	"pages": [
		{
			"id": "ApplicationDetail",
			"route": "/applications/:id",
			"type": "detail",
			"title": "Application",
			"config": {
				"register": "humaniq",
				"schema": "job-application",
				"_note": "recruiting-ats-basic (2026-07-13): candidate PII (candidateName/email/phone/cvFile/motivation) lives DIRECTLY on this Application -- there is deliberately no separate Candidate entity (AVG data-minimisation, design D2): one object = one retention clock = one delete. The 'Application' widget excludes vacancyId (Related resolves the Vacancy) and the three privacy fields (talentPoolOptIn/rejectedDate/retentionExpiryDate), which instead surface on the dedicated 'Privacy & retention' widget so the AVG retention clock is never buried among ordinary fields. lifecycleActions expose exactly screenen/uitnodigen/aanbieden/aannemen/afwijzen (design D3) -- no invented edges; after aannemen, the Create employee header action (hiring-hire-to-employee) opens HireApplicationDialog (src/dialogs), which creates the Employee and the Onboarding case from this application or attaches the hire to an earlier record; the transition itself writes no other object. employeeId then shows under Related, and pressing Create employee again opens the same employee. Audit history is a sidebar tab. offer-esign (2026-07-16): page-level action \"request-offer-signature\" mirrors PayslipDetail's \"Genereer PDF\" shape -- POST /api/offer/request-signature with {applicationId: @objectId}, guarded server-side by OfferController::authorizeApplication() (resolve-first RBAC) + isAdminOrHr() + the aanbod-stage guard. The 'Application' data widget's exclude list additionally hides offerLetterFileId/offerSigningRequestId (internal correlation ids) -- offerSigningStatus stays visible as the human-readable state. hiring-candidate-assessment (2026-09-30): the candidate's profile fields (education level, years, competences) and the referral source show in the data widget; Evaluations lists the CandidateEvaluation records (object-list), Average scores reads GET /api/applications/{id}/evaluation-summary (endpoint-table: OpenRegister's aggregation cannot group the nested scores list), and Score this candidate opens the evaluation form; the evaluator is stamped by the server.",
				"sidebar": {
					"enabled": true,
					"showMetadata": true
				},
				"widgets": [
					{
						"id": "data",
						"type": "data",
						"title": "Application",
						"icon": "FileAccountOutline",
						"content": {
							"columns": 2,
							"exclude": [
								"vacancyId",
								"talentPoolOptIn",
								"rejectedDate",
								"retentionExpiryDate",
								"offerLetterFileId",
								"offerSigningRequestId",
								"answers",
								"employeeId"
							],
							"title": "Application"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "answers",
						"type": "application-answers",
						"title": "Answers to the vacancy questions",
						"icon": "FormSelect",
						"content": {}
					},
					{
						"id": "data-2",
						"type": "data",
						"title": "Privacy & retention",
						"icon": "ShieldLockOutline",
						"content": {
							"columns": 2,
							"include": [
								"talentPoolOptIn",
								"rejectedDate",
								"retentionExpiryDate"
							],
							"title": "Privacy & retention"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "related",
						"type": "related",
						"title": "Related",
						"icon": "LinkVariant",
						"content": {
							"title": "Related"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "files",
						"type": "files",
						"title": "CV & cover letter",
						"icon": "FolderOutline"
					},
					{
						"id": "object-list",
						"type": "object-list",
						"title": "Interviews",
						"icon": "CalendarAccountOutline",
						"content": {
							"register": "humaniq",
							"schema": "Interview",
							"filter": {
								"applicationId": "@objectId"
							},
							"sort": {
								"field": "scheduledStart",
								"dir": "desc"
							},
							"columns": [
								{
									"key": "scheduledStart",
									"label": "Start"
								},
								{
									"key": "mode",
									"label": "Mode"
								},
								{
									"key": "location",
									"label": "Location"
								},
								{
									"key": "status",
									"label": "Status"
								}
							],
							"limit": 25,
							"rowRoute": "InterviewDetail",
							"viewAllRoute": "Interviews",
							"viewAllQuery": {
								"applicationId": "@objectId"
							},
							"emptyText": "No interviews scheduled yet"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "evaluations",
						"type": "object-list",
						"title": "Evaluations",
						"icon": "StarOutline",
						"content": {
							"register": "humaniq",
							"schema": "CandidateEvaluation",
							"filter": {
								"applicationId": "@objectId"
							},
							"sort": {
								"field": "submittedAt",
								"dir": "desc"
							},
							"columns": [
								{
									"key": "evaluatorUserId",
									"label": "Evaluator"
								},
								{
									"key": "recommendation",
									"label": "Recommendation"
								},
								{
									"key": "submittedAt",
									"label": "Submitted"
								},
								{
									"key": "note",
									"label": "Note"
								}
							],
							"limit": 25,
							"emptyText": "No one has scored this candidate yet."
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "evaluation-averages",
						"type": "endpoint-table",
						"title": "Average scores",
						"icon": "ChartBar",
						"content": {
							"endpointSource": {
								"url": "/apps/humaniq/api/applications/@objectId/evaluation-summary",
								"responsePath": "criteria"
