		{
			"config": {
				"_note": "recruiting-ats-basic (2026-07-13): the 'Vacancy' widget carries every field (title/description/department/status/publishedDate/closingDate). The 'Sollicitaties' related widget resolves the incoming Application.vacancyId references -- the candidate list per vacancy. lifecycleActions expose exactly publiceren/sluiten (design D3) -- no re-open and no publish-from-closed edge; a closed vacancy is re-created, not resurrected. Audit history is a sidebar tab. hiring-portal-audiences (2026-09-30): expanded from simpleDetailScaffold to carry the 'Application questions' host widget (vacancy-questions, CnFormBuilder), whose list portaliq shows on the public apply form; answers land on job-application.answers. hiring-multiposting (2026-09-30): channels on the data widget (the job boards HR ticks) and a Job boards object-list of the VacancyPosting records the Vacature plaatsen and Vacature intrekken flows write, one per board. hiring-candidate-assessment (2026-09-30): the evaluation criteria and the requirements (minimum education level, years, required and preferred competences) on the data widget, and Who fits: the ranked matches from GET /api/vacancies/{id}/matches with the points per requirement and what is missing. The score ranks; it never moves an application.",
				"layout": [
					{
						"gridHeight": 8,
						"gridWidth": 8,
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 0,
						"id": 1,
						"widgetId": "data"
					},
					{
						"gridHeight": 8,
						"gridWidth": 4,
						"gridX": 8,
						"gridY": 0,
						"id": 2,
						"widgetId": "related"
					},
					{
						"id": 3,
						"widgetId": "questions",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 8,
						"gridWidth": 12,
						"gridHeight": 8
